> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1089198-what-do-the-hsien-do?p=1090215#post1090215\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ponder how the hell the Tanuki and the Kitsune ended up completely different orders of beings....</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe there's more than one of each? As an example of this sort of situation with another youkai, the tengu skull on the desk of the SF0 director couldn't have come from a Werewolf tengu, because it maintains its mixed avian and human features. If it were a W:tA tengu, it would have changed back into a normal human or crow skull on death.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-09T08:01:19-07:00","id":1090311,"title":"","content":"For japanese yokai I'd ignore using splats and allowed players to make any Shinto &quot;kith&quot; they can realistically play in modern chronicle up to creatures of urban legends.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>...","edited":{"userid":5211,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5211-firkraag","user":"Firkraag","date":". 05-09-2017, 11:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5211-firkraag","name":"Firkraag